WEBVTT

00:24.896 --> 00:28.000
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

00:31.123 --> 00:34.080
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

00:37.216 --> 00:40.736
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

00:42.656 --> 00:47.712
♪I've become the center of the story♪

00:48.608 --> 00:52.978
♪I must escape this dream♪

00:54.560 --> 00:59.160
♪Yet why does my heart
surrender before you♪

01:00.128 --> 01:04.032
♪Clearly, it's a fake plot♪

01:04.352 --> 01:06.528
♪A fake world♪

01:07.232 --> 01:12.224
♪Yet eventually,
my heart is open to you♪

01:37.088 --> 01:40.896
=My Page in the 90s=
(Adapted from "Bye, Wild Weasel")

01:41.096 --> 01:44.040
=Episode 6=

01:44.940 --> 01:45.899
So Mr. Gao,

01:46.300 --> 01:48.459
you're only willing to be a catalyst
in my love life

01:49.099 --> 01:50.379
and don't want to be part of it?

01:59.379 --> 02:00.500
Your hair is messy.

02:42.939 --> 02:45.700
Boss, it seems like Lin Huan'er
has been the one flirting with you.

02:46.700 --> 02:48.659
She moved your afternoon tea
to the riverside.

02:51.420 --> 02:52.380
Use these.

02:52.899 --> 02:53.608
Okay.

03:01.992 --> 03:02.760
(Exclusive: Letao CEO Gao Haiming
Dating Mysterious Woman)

03:03.020 --> 03:04.260
Look at what your precious son

03:04.260 --> 03:05.339
has done.

03:06.580 --> 03:08.059
Is he trying to provoke me?

03:22.248 --> 03:23.240
(Exclusive: Letao CEO Gao Haiming
Dating Mysterious Woman)

03:28.328 --> 03:29.980
(Exclusive: Letao CEO Gao Haiming)
I was wondering

03:30.339 --> 03:31.899
(Dating Mysterious Woman)
why the progress was so rapid,

03:32.100 --> 03:34.540
but the fondness level
hasn't increased at all.

03:37.700 --> 03:39.059
Lin Huan'er,

03:39.980 --> 03:41.339
you're destroying

03:41.339 --> 03:43.179
the evidence of your two-timing.

03:43.860 --> 03:44.939
No,

03:45.860 --> 03:47.779
this is evidence of him using me.

03:48.820 --> 03:50.820
Although I did want to outmaneuver him,

03:51.219 --> 03:53.300
he actually outmaneuvered me first.

04:01.899 --> 04:04.540
What's really going on between you two?

04:04.779 --> 04:05.820
Explain it to me clearly.

04:06.580 --> 04:08.899
There's really nothing between us.

04:09.339 --> 04:10.779
You won't even tell me?

04:11.739 --> 04:13.820
But I have nothing to say,

04:13.820 --> 04:14.659
Mengmeng.

04:17.060 --> 04:18.020
We really

04:18.020 --> 04:19.659
haven't reached that stage.

04:20.419 --> 04:21.580
In this whole thing,

04:22.099 --> 04:23.659
I'm also a victim.

04:24.260 --> 04:25.539
Think about it carefully.

04:26.060 --> 04:28.099
Without my consent,

04:28.099 --> 04:29.500
my photo was taken

04:29.500 --> 04:30.820
and published in a magazine.

04:32.859 --> 04:34.419
Shouldn't you comfort

04:34.419 --> 04:35.740
my wounded heart?

04:40.899 --> 04:42.500
But I have to remind you,

04:43.020 --> 04:44.820
Xiaojue is coming back
in a couple of days.

04:44.820 --> 04:45.740
Be careful.

04:46.380 --> 04:47.899
Why should I be careful?

04:48.180 --> 04:48.779
Mengmeng,

04:48.779 --> 04:50.020
there's really nothing

04:50.020 --> 04:51.459
between Gao Haiming and me.

04:51.459 --> 04:52.659
I believe you.

04:54.779 --> 04:55.979
But still, be careful.

04:57.459 --> 04:59.180
Careful of what?

05:03.180 --> 05:04.419
What do you think?

05:10.472 --> 05:13.416
(17 missed calls, 8 unread messages)

05:23.048 --> 05:25.448
(Yunsheng Tower)

05:35.528 --> 05:36.740
(Exclusive: Letao CEO Gao Haiming
Dating Mysterious Woman)

05:36.740 --> 05:38.500
Did you really land Mr. Gao?

05:40.060 --> 05:41.020
You may not believe it,

05:41.459 --> 05:43.219
but I genuinely know nothing.

05:43.659 --> 05:44.779
You know nothing?

05:45.419 --> 05:46.740
Yet you landed Mr. Gao?

05:46.740 --> 05:47.459
No.

05:47.459 --> 05:48.180
My girl,

05:48.580 --> 05:49.500
that's impressive.

05:53.979 --> 05:54.659
Hello?

05:54.779 --> 05:56.539
(Lin, you're something.)

05:56.620 --> 05:57.859
(You're the top contributor.)

05:57.859 --> 05:58.740
(Promotion and raise.)

05:58.740 --> 06:00.979
(Name it,
and I'll give you whatever you want.)

06:00.979 --> 06:02.339
I don't want anything.

06:02.339 --> 06:03.820
Mr. Fang, I only have one request.

06:03.820 --> 06:05.580
Let me keep doing errands for Letao.

06:05.979 --> 06:07.659
I'm just meant to be a runner.

06:07.659 --> 06:08.779
I love running errands.

06:09.140 --> 06:10.380
As for rewards,

06:10.380 --> 06:11.779
bonuses, and commissions,

06:12.339 --> 06:14.020
just credit them all to Ms. Xiang.

06:14.020 --> 06:15.419
Give them all to her. I want none.

06:15.700 --> 06:16.296
That's all.

06:20.380 --> 06:21.180
Lin Huan'er,

06:21.500 --> 06:22.219
I actually thought

06:22.219 --> 06:23.820
you won those deals on merit.

06:24.020 --> 06:26.459
Turns out
you're still relying on seducing men.

06:27.219 --> 06:28.580
I order you now

06:28.580 --> 06:30.339
to go to Rose Manor on Nantong Mountain.

06:31.219 --> 06:32.380
I have no time. Not going.

06:32.500 --> 06:33.580
(Side quest activated.)

06:33.659 --> 06:35.380
(You must follow
Xie Wanjun's instructions,)

06:35.380 --> 06:36.899
(or you'll trigger the punishment.)

06:36.940 --> 06:38.580
You're messing with me, aren't you?

06:38.779 --> 06:40.820
Yes, I am messing with you.

06:41.140 --> 06:42.459
Didn't you give me the chance?

06:43.020 --> 06:44.620
Now, go

06:44.620 --> 06:46.020
to Rose Manor on Nantong Mountain.

06:46.299 --> 06:47.219
Or perhaps

06:47.580 --> 06:48.979
you want to sabotage your company's

06:48.979 --> 06:50.020
cooperation with us?

06:50.700 --> 06:51.899
Immediately. Right now.

06:51.899 --> 06:53.820
I'll go. I'll go.

06:54.299 --> 06:55.260
I'll go, okay?

06:59.020 --> 06:59.620
Ms. Xiang.

07:01.500 --> 07:02.099
Where is she?

07:04.500 --> 07:05.620
Wang Zhen, the contract.

07:06.219 --> 07:06.779
Coming.

07:07.060 --> 07:07.659
Huan'er.

07:08.700 --> 07:09.299
Thank you.

07:10.020 --> 07:10.820
Thanks, Ms. Xiang.

07:10.820 --> 07:11.779
Why call me Ms. Xiang?

07:12.659 --> 07:13.539
Call me Lingling.

07:14.740 --> 07:15.459
Why?

07:16.020 --> 07:17.940
I heard everything you said
on the phone.

07:30.459 --> 07:31.219
Focus on your work.

07:31.720 --> 07:35.432
(Natural Beauty, Romantic Rendezvous,
Dream Destination)

07:42.020 --> 07:42.700
Thanks.

07:47.176 --> 07:50.376
(Rose Manor)

07:50.700 --> 07:52.180
Well, Wanjun.

07:52.899 --> 07:54.459
I'm really disappointed in you.

07:55.419 --> 07:56.500
What era is this?

07:56.500 --> 07:58.740
You're still pulling

07:58.740 --> 07:59.620
(Rose Manor)
the "female lead in distress

07:59.620 --> 08:01.180
in the middle of nowhere" trope?

08:03.099 --> 08:04.380
With tricks like this,

08:04.740 --> 08:05.659
how could you

08:05.659 --> 08:06.859
ever win over Haiming?

08:07.260 --> 08:08.580
I'm anxious just watching you.

08:12.168 --> 08:14.088
(Rose Manor)

08:17.896 --> 08:19.016
(Current stop: Nantong Mountain)

08:20.616 --> 08:21.580
(Current stop: Nantong Mountain
First bus: 5 AM, last Bus: 5 PM)

08:21.580 --> 08:23.099
From 5 AM to 5 PM.

08:25.979 --> 08:28.380
5:01 PM? What bad timing.

08:31.496 --> 08:32.520
(Current stop: Nantong Mountain)

08:40.020 --> 08:40.779
Hello?

08:43.939 --> 08:45.100
So heartless.

08:49.059 --> 08:50.579
Hello? Could you help me?

08:50.779 --> 08:51.460
Hello?

08:56.939 --> 08:58.100
How strange.

09:00.819 --> 09:01.699
No way.

09:05.299 --> 09:06.380
I don't believe this.

09:07.659 --> 09:08.539
Hey handsome. Hello?

09:09.380 --> 09:10.299
Here's the situation.

09:11.260 --> 09:12.380
I don't have my...

09:12.380 --> 09:14.140
I... I don't have my phone.

09:14.140 --> 09:15.860
Could I borrow your phone
to make a call?

09:15.860 --> 09:17.140
I'm stranded here.

09:17.779 --> 09:20.020
You... Can't you see me?

09:24.299 --> 09:25.620
Can't you see me?

09:37.100 --> 09:37.819
I get it.

09:38.980 --> 09:40.100
Could it be

09:40.779 --> 09:42.860
that only the male lead can save me?

09:43.980 --> 09:45.140
The female lead's in trouble.

09:45.500 --> 09:47.020
Only the male lead can save her.

09:47.340 --> 09:48.299
Nobody else can help.

09:48.779 --> 09:50.299
And I can't save myself either, right?

09:51.899 --> 09:53.460
This is really cliched.

09:54.380 --> 09:55.779
Could we get something original?

09:57.699 --> 09:58.220
Mr. Gao,

09:58.419 --> 10:00.140
Miss Xie saw the photos in the magazine.

10:00.699 --> 10:01.380
Get to the point.

10:02.020 --> 10:02.819
She's made Miss Lin

10:02.819 --> 10:04.460
personally send the files
to the suburbs.

10:06.899 --> 10:07.699
I think

10:07.699 --> 10:09.059
it's about to pour.

10:11.980 --> 10:12.539
Mr. Gao?

10:14.059 --> 10:15.659
So when will he come to rescue me?

10:23.208 --> 10:24.419
(Call back 8754321. From Gao Haiming)

10:24.419 --> 10:25.460
There he is.

10:25.899 --> 10:27.819
Have me call him back?

10:28.460 --> 10:29.699
But I don't have a phone.

10:30.059 --> 10:31.059
Where is the...

10:32.819 --> 10:34.179
(Smooth talk, seamless link)
No way.

10:34.419 --> 10:37.020
Why is there a phone booth here?

10:40.100 --> 10:41.059
Absurd.

10:41.419 --> 10:43.699
Did a phone booth
just magically appear here?

10:46.500 --> 10:48.419
Fine. I'll make the call.

10:51.720 --> 10:53.960
(Smooth talk, seamless link)

10:58.779 --> 10:59.539
Ten cents.

11:00.939 --> 11:02.299
How long can I talk for ten cents?

11:20.579 --> 11:21.224
Hello?

11:21.819 --> 11:22.579
Mr. Gao, hello.

11:22.579 --> 11:23.460
This is Lin Huan'er.

11:24.939 --> 11:26.460
Miss Lin, what can I do for you?

11:26.760 --> 11:27.340
Well,

11:27.340 --> 11:28.179
time is tight.

11:28.179 --> 11:29.140
I'll be brief.

11:29.340 --> 11:30.340
I'm nowhere.

11:30.340 --> 11:31.179
I know no one here.

11:31.179 --> 11:31.980
There's not anyone

11:31.980 --> 11:32.740
or a car in sight.

11:33.100 --> 11:33.819
If possible,

11:33.819 --> 11:34.779
please tell Mengmeng

11:34.779 --> 11:35.500
and my family

11:35.500 --> 11:36.899
I might not make it back today.

11:38.059 --> 11:38.579
Okay.

11:38.860 --> 11:40.659
Don't worry, I'll pass it along.

11:41.380 --> 11:42.579
Wait, Mr. Gao, what I meant is

11:42.579 --> 11:43.620
if you're free now,

11:43.620 --> 11:44.899
can you come and save me?

11:45.179 --> 11:46.579
I'm at Nantong Mountain's Rose...

11:48.380 --> 11:48.939
Hello?

11:49.620 --> 11:50.140
Hello?

11:52.020 --> 11:52.620
Hello?

11:53.579 --> 11:54.260
That's it?

11:56.020 --> 11:56.699
That was short.

12:01.539 --> 12:03.020
Luo? Luo!

12:03.340 --> 12:03.939
Mr. Gao.

12:04.059 --> 12:06.440
Look into places near Nantong Mountain
starting with "Rose".

12:06.539 --> 12:07.699
Got it. I'm on it.

12:21.059 --> 12:22.299
This weather

12:22.579 --> 12:24.500
looks like rain.

12:24.939 --> 12:26.659
Please, I'm struggling enough.

12:26.659 --> 12:28.059
Don't make this harder for me.

12:28.059 --> 12:28.819
Okay?

12:32.260 --> 12:33.740
Please don't rain.

12:34.179 --> 12:35.620
I won't complain about you, okay?

12:35.939 --> 12:37.460
I mean it. I won't.

12:38.020 --> 12:39.500
Don't you dare rain now.

12:44.939 --> 12:46.299
No way.

13:14.659 --> 13:15.460
(Could someone)

13:15.460 --> 13:17.860
(suddenly appear and save me?)

14:06.179 --> 14:06.819
Let's go.

14:46.819 --> 14:47.659
Gao Haiming,

14:48.699 --> 14:50.620
if you come pick me up right now,

14:51.340 --> 14:53.260
I'll let bygones be bygones

14:54.140 --> 14:55.299
and forgive you.

15:08.740 --> 15:10.500
Miss, why are you here?

15:11.140 --> 15:12.819
I'm a taxi driver.
I just finished my shift.

15:12.819 --> 15:13.819
Let me give you a ride.

15:13.819 --> 15:14.980
Sure, thanks.

15:14.980 --> 15:16.260
I see you don't have shoes.

15:16.260 --> 15:17.860
I happen to have a pair right here.

15:17.980 --> 15:18.819
Put these on for now.

15:18.819 --> 15:19.779
Thank you so much.

15:19.779 --> 15:20.380
You're welcome.

15:20.620 --> 15:21.659
Come on, get in quick.

15:23.432 --> 15:24.011
Thank you.

15:30.140 --> 15:31.299
I have a bag of things here.

15:31.419 --> 15:32.340
You can use them.

15:35.740 --> 15:36.539
Tissues?

15:37.539 --> 15:38.340
A towel?

15:38.740 --> 15:39.539
A thermos?

15:40.579 --> 15:41.980
Clean socks?

15:43.179 --> 15:44.620
And a jacket?

15:45.020 --> 15:45.860
I get it.

15:46.539 --> 15:48.740
You're the Newbie Pack
the system sent me, aren't you?

15:50.299 --> 15:51.179
It's fine.

15:51.179 --> 15:52.020
I get it.

15:52.100 --> 15:52.860
Drive on.

15:53.020 --> 15:53.539
Alright.

15:53.899 --> 15:55.299
- You lousy system.
- Buckle up now.

15:55.299 --> 15:56.340
You do have some decency.

16:12.872 --> 16:16.680
♪Old photos, yellowed♪

16:16.680 --> 16:20.968
♪Timelines, tangled♪

16:21.576 --> 16:25.192
♪I boarded a rickety time machine♪

16:25.860 --> 16:27.260
(Mr. Gao, I found it.)

16:30.260 --> 16:30.939
Do this.

16:31.419 --> 16:33.419
Get a towel, a jacket,

16:34.100 --> 16:35.400
and a pair of women's slippers.

16:35.899 --> 16:36.779
Get the car.

16:37.419 --> 16:38.059
Understood.

16:41.288 --> 16:46.568
♪Lighting up my lonely corner♪

16:47.784 --> 16:54.100
♪Love's time machine, flying on and on♪

16:54.100 --> 16:54.620
Hello, sir.

16:54.620 --> 16:55.272
Hello.

16:55.860 --> 16:56.779
Give this bag to her.

16:57.059 --> 16:58.579
But tell her it's from you.

17:00.179 --> 17:01.579
Why don't you deliver it yourself?

17:03.140 --> 17:04.339
Got it. Being romantic?

17:04.660 --> 17:05.980
Got it. Don't worry.

17:05.980 --> 17:06.619
Thanks.

17:11.432 --> 17:15.848
♪Streaking across the sky♪

17:16.840 --> 17:24.424
♪Just to hold you♪

17:46.139 --> 17:48.180
(Male lead's fondness toward you
is soaring,)

17:48.180 --> 17:50.020
(currently at one percent.)

17:52.059 --> 17:53.700
(Getting rained on is that effective?)

17:54.460 --> 17:55.220
(Not bad.)

17:57.779 --> 18:00.379
(Seems I need more interactions
with Miss Xie from now on.)

18:03.099 --> 18:05.460
Sir, take me to Fuchuang International.

18:05.940 --> 18:06.579
Thanks.

18:17.740 --> 18:18.500
Miss Xie,

18:19.539 --> 18:20.740
here are the files you wanted.

18:20.740 --> 18:21.928
Luckily, they didn't get wet.

18:23.020 --> 18:24.299
You picked the right moment.

18:24.619 --> 18:25.980
I was just about to leave.

18:29.099 --> 18:30.379
After all this trouble,

18:30.740 --> 18:31.779
are you satisfied now?

18:32.500 --> 18:33.339
Just mediocre.

18:33.779 --> 18:36.260
I wish you'd just disappear
from my life forever.

18:36.900 --> 18:38.940
Funny, that's exactly
what I was thinking.

18:39.299 --> 18:40.660
So listen carefully

18:40.660 --> 18:41.740
to what I say next.

18:43.180 --> 18:46.099
You have a critical flaw.

18:47.260 --> 18:48.579
You're trying too hard.

18:49.059 --> 18:50.900
but in the wrong direction.

18:51.700 --> 18:52.940
Targeting me like this

18:53.299 --> 18:54.819
might make you feel a bit better,

18:55.420 --> 18:56.420
but does this get you

18:56.420 --> 18:57.700
Gao Haiming's affection?

18:58.940 --> 18:59.660
So,

18:59.859 --> 19:00.779
figure out

19:00.779 --> 19:02.180
what you truly want first.

19:02.180 --> 19:03.299
Then work towards that.

19:03.940 --> 19:05.220
That's my business.

19:05.460 --> 19:06.900
What's it to you?

19:07.379 --> 19:08.779
I'm just trying to tell you,

19:09.619 --> 19:11.500
we shouldn't be rivals.

19:11.940 --> 19:13.660
I'm not the person
you need to deal with.

19:14.139 --> 19:15.379
It should be Gao Haiming.

19:15.660 --> 19:17.379
Focus on winning over Gao Haiming.

19:18.299 --> 19:19.339
If you only target me,

19:19.339 --> 19:20.900
even if you launch me into space,

19:21.099 --> 19:22.260
new girls will continue

19:22.260 --> 19:23.420
to appear around Gao Haiming.

19:23.579 --> 19:24.180
Right?

19:25.740 --> 19:27.260
And Miss Xie,

19:27.579 --> 19:28.779
you're so beautiful,

19:29.059 --> 19:30.139
charming,

19:30.139 --> 19:31.180
and accomplished.

19:31.500 --> 19:32.339
You shouldn't just be

19:32.339 --> 19:33.260
a supporting character

19:33.260 --> 19:34.260
in Gao Haiming's story.

19:34.500 --> 19:36.660
You should be the female lead

19:36.660 --> 19:37.900
in your own story.

19:38.539 --> 19:39.220
Understand?

19:42.420 --> 19:43.260
I'm done.

19:43.740 --> 19:44.260
Go for it.

19:54.500 --> 19:58.220
Being the female lead in my own story?

20:00.299 --> 20:01.619
I need to be more proactive.

20:02.460 --> 20:04.859
and make Gao Haiming
be a supporting role to me.

20:08.260 --> 20:09.500
Mr. Gao. Mr. Gao.

20:09.700 --> 20:11.299
We have a problem. Miss Xie is here.

20:18.940 --> 20:21.020
Come on everyone, have some snacks.

20:21.020 --> 20:22.139
Miss Xie is treating you all

20:22.139 --> 20:23.740
to afternoon tea on Mr. Gao's behalf.

20:24.260 --> 20:25.180
- Thank you.
- Here.

20:25.379 --> 20:26.260
- Thanks.
- You're welcome.

20:26.260 --> 20:27.099
You're welcome. Here.

20:27.619 --> 20:28.180
Thank you.

20:28.700 --> 20:31.339
Mr. Gao, Miss Xie is very thoughtful.

20:32.539 --> 20:34.220
But you can't force love.

20:34.500 --> 20:36.220
She's completely wasting her time.

20:39.500 --> 20:40.700
Are our company's doors

20:40.700 --> 20:42.139
open to anyone?

20:42.660 --> 20:44.900
Thank you.
Wishing you and Mr. Gao happiness.

20:45.139 --> 20:46.020
Thank you.

20:46.099 --> 20:47.059
Have other colleagues

20:47.059 --> 20:48.139
get afternoon tea too.

20:48.139 --> 20:48.740
Got it.

20:48.740 --> 20:50.900
It must be the Chairman who let her in.

21:01.339 --> 21:02.339
Here, Huan'er.

21:02.700 --> 21:03.619
Take the cold medicine.

21:04.660 --> 21:05.420
Look at you.

21:05.420 --> 21:06.740
Why not go home and rest?

21:07.579 --> 21:09.700
I'm fine. This is nothing.

21:10.180 --> 21:11.260
I can't rest now.

21:13.859 --> 21:14.500
Outstanding.

21:23.260 --> 21:24.260
Mr. Fang. Mr. Fang.

21:25.900 --> 21:28.020
Is this contract
supposed to go to Letao?

21:28.139 --> 21:28.900
I can do it.

21:30.420 --> 21:31.740
You've got a cold?

21:33.420 --> 21:34.660
This contract...

21:35.059 --> 21:36.260
It's already processed.

21:36.379 --> 21:37.579
But in your condition...

21:38.139 --> 21:39.099
(Letao Maternal and Infant PR Contract)
I-I'll deliver it.

21:39.500 --> 21:40.299
Not appropriate.

21:40.648 --> 21:41.544
(Letao Maternal and Infant PR Contract)

21:43.020 --> 21:45.379
I must personally...

21:47.260 --> 21:48.180
She's going that far?

21:49.139 --> 21:49.980
Impressive.

21:55.099 --> 21:55.980
Haiming.

21:55.980 --> 21:56.859
Miss Xie.

21:58.500 --> 22:00.180
I must discuss key business
with Mr. Gao.

22:00.180 --> 22:00.900
You may leave.

22:01.139 --> 22:02.779
Don't enter unless called.

22:04.859 --> 22:05.420
Go.

22:11.020 --> 22:11.940
Haiming,

22:12.980 --> 22:14.420
I made these myself.

22:14.579 --> 22:15.220
Try some.

22:17.379 --> 22:19.460
Miss Xie, what brings you here today?

22:26.099 --> 22:27.859
I drafted it these past few days.

22:28.020 --> 22:30.260
The Fuchuang and Letao
Strategic Cooperation Agreement.

22:30.260 --> 22:31.139
Please take a look.

22:35.180 --> 22:37.059
Just send it to our legal department.

22:37.619 --> 22:38.819
If there's nothing else...

22:38.819 --> 22:39.740
Haiming,

22:40.420 --> 22:42.059
we grew up together.

22:42.500 --> 22:43.940
A decade-long friendship

22:44.500 --> 22:45.740
is truly rare.

22:47.339 --> 22:48.619
That was all childhood stuff.

22:55.539 --> 22:56.180
Miss Lin.

22:57.460 --> 22:59.819
Miss Lin.
Mr. Gao and Miss Xie are inside.

22:59.819 --> 23:00.700
No one's allowed in.

23:01.099 --> 23:02.139
Miss Xie is here?

23:03.339 --> 23:04.660
I'm delivering a file to Mr. Gao.

23:04.900 --> 23:05.819
If you go in

23:05.819 --> 23:07.339
and he gets mad, he'll yell at me.

23:08.779 --> 23:09.779
I'll take responsibility.

23:09.779 --> 23:10.379
You're safe.

23:13.619 --> 23:14.900
When we were little,

23:15.180 --> 23:17.180
to pick a flower for me,

23:17.819 --> 23:19.379
you got scratched by a branch.

23:19.779 --> 23:21.099
Let me see if the scar remains.

23:21.099 --> 23:22.020
It's gone, Miss Xie.

23:22.020 --> 23:22.819
- It's gone.
- Let me see.

23:22.819 --> 23:23.539
It's gone already.

23:23.660 --> 23:24.779
- Let me...
- It's really gone.

23:27.260 --> 23:28.539
My timing couldn't be worse.

23:28.900 --> 23:30.740
Well, you two carry on.

23:30.740 --> 23:31.500
When you're done,

23:31.500 --> 23:33.500
I'll discuss work with Mr. Gao.

23:36.619 --> 23:39.099
Lin Huan'er, it's you again.

23:42.099 --> 23:43.980
Are these the cookies you gave Mr. Gao?

23:44.500 --> 23:45.859
How could you send cookies?

23:46.139 --> 23:47.379
Mr. Gao quit sugar ages ago.

23:47.379 --> 23:48.500
Didn't you know?

23:50.059 --> 23:50.819
No worries.

23:51.099 --> 23:52.980
Learn more before gifting next time.

23:53.539 --> 23:54.859
It's easier after the first.

23:55.180 --> 23:56.700
Just don't send sweets next time.

23:56.700 --> 23:57.619
He dislikes them.

23:58.220 --> 23:59.980
None of your business. Get out.

24:00.220 --> 24:01.460
Wait, you...

24:08.180 --> 24:10.859
Miss Xie,
Miss Lin is my business partner.

24:10.859 --> 24:11.859
This isn't appropriate.

24:12.700 --> 24:13.980
You're defending her?

24:14.500 --> 24:16.619
All partners are equal with me.

24:16.940 --> 24:18.260
If there's nothing else today,

24:18.700 --> 24:19.660
we'll talk another time.

24:25.819 --> 24:26.420
Take care.

24:32.740 --> 24:33.299
Are you okay?

24:34.099 --> 24:34.819
You're sick?

24:37.500 --> 24:39.099
Thanks to you.

24:39.099 --> 24:41.740
I got sick
after getting caught in the rain.

24:42.180 --> 24:44.099
You owe me for this.

24:46.339 --> 24:47.339
Then how can I repay you?

24:49.900 --> 24:51.779
You can owe me for now.

24:51.900 --> 24:53.220
Wait till I think of how.

24:55.020 --> 24:55.579
Deal.

24:56.379 --> 24:58.024
I'll get you a leave and take you home.

25:06.139 --> 25:07.339
(Male lead's fondness)

25:07.339 --> 25:08.940
(toward you rose to 22 percent.)

25:16.299 --> 25:18.420
I was just about to call you, Huan'er.

25:18.420 --> 25:19.420
Are you feeling better?

25:19.619 --> 25:20.500
I'm out shopping.

25:20.500 --> 25:21.460
Come join me.

25:22.299 --> 25:23.940
Shopping at this hour?

25:25.139 --> 25:27.619
Aren't I going
to the police station event tomorrow?

25:27.900 --> 25:30.539
I wanted to get some new outfits.

25:32.299 --> 25:33.740
Going to the event?

25:34.299 --> 25:36.059
For that romantically dense guy?

25:38.940 --> 25:39.900
Got it.

25:39.900 --> 25:41.020
I understand.

25:41.859 --> 25:42.900
Enjoy your shopping then.

25:43.180 --> 25:44.539
I won't join you tonight.

25:46.059 --> 25:47.460
I'll get you some supper later.

25:48.500 --> 25:50.420
No need. I'm not hungry.

25:51.539 --> 25:54.020
Alright. Get some rest.

26:17.500 --> 26:18.099
Hello?

26:18.260 --> 26:20.139
Hello. Why aren't you here today?

26:20.460 --> 26:21.900
The event starts soon.

26:22.180 --> 26:23.020
Attendance

26:23.020 --> 26:24.299
doesn't match registrations.

26:24.539 --> 26:25.576
My superior is asking me.

26:27.619 --> 26:29.539
I probably can't make it today.

26:30.500 --> 26:32.260
What's wrong? Feeling unwell?

26:33.020 --> 26:34.660
Not me. Huan'er.

26:35.980 --> 26:36.859
Is she better?

26:37.700 --> 26:39.260
She should be feeling better now.

26:40.660 --> 26:42.339
Officer, you're so handsome.

26:42.660 --> 26:43.180
Excuse me.

26:43.180 --> 26:44.420
Can you show me this?

26:46.020 --> 26:46.980
Yeah, hold on.

26:47.700 --> 26:48.299
Sorry.

26:48.379 --> 26:49.740
Everyone's pairing up now.

26:49.740 --> 26:50.700
I need to go.

26:51.579 --> 26:52.139
Wait.

26:54.740 --> 26:55.619
Pairing up?

27:11.020 --> 27:11.980
So dramatic.

27:12.180 --> 27:13.539
It's just a little rain.

27:13.900 --> 27:16.059
She ran to Haiming
to play the delicate one.

27:16.180 --> 27:17.139
Is that necessary?

27:19.539 --> 27:21.660
Wanjun, if you want
to achieve big things,

27:22.099 --> 27:23.539
you can't lose your cool.

27:24.260 --> 27:26.500
Dad, it's not me losing my cool.

27:26.900 --> 27:27.980
It's Lin Huan'er

27:27.980 --> 27:29.900
who is incredibly cunning.

27:30.619 --> 27:31.420
This move

27:31.700 --> 27:33.980
not only made Haiming
feel sorry for her,

27:34.539 --> 27:35.819
but also painted me

27:35.819 --> 27:37.099
as a petty and malicious person.

27:40.059 --> 27:41.379
I will think of something.

27:43.740 --> 27:44.660
Do you want

27:45.139 --> 27:47.059
to speed things up with Haiming?

27:48.859 --> 27:49.859
Of course.

27:50.260 --> 27:52.059
Then visit him tomorrow

27:52.500 --> 27:53.900
to discuss this matter properly.

27:54.700 --> 27:55.619
Tomorrow?

27:56.180 --> 27:57.220
Sooner rather than later.

27:58.059 --> 27:59.260
Letao is transitioning.

27:59.260 --> 28:00.539
They need our support.

28:01.220 --> 28:02.220
Sooner or later,

28:02.740 --> 28:04.579
Letao will rely on our Fuchuang.

28:05.139 --> 28:06.500
He won't escape you then.

28:12.328 --> 28:14.088
(Letao Tower)

28:19.660 --> 28:20.299
Mr. Gao,

28:20.700 --> 28:21.579
Mr. Lin and Mr. Huang

28:21.579 --> 28:23.112
are in supplier renewal negotiation.

28:23.420 --> 28:24.299
Due to the recent

28:24.299 --> 28:25.500
diaper insect infestation,

28:25.779 --> 28:27.099
agency prices have fluctuated.

28:27.379 --> 28:28.139
They hope

28:28.139 --> 28:29.420
we can offer some plans soon

28:29.420 --> 28:30.339
to reduce the impact

28:30.339 --> 28:31.500
and enhance brand influence.

28:35.099 --> 28:37.660
Make an international call
to Mr. Lin and Mr. Huang now.

28:37.819 --> 28:39.859
First renew the contracts,
then plan the marketing.

28:40.619 --> 28:41.180
Understood.

28:42.940 --> 28:43.940
How's our plan?

28:44.339 --> 28:45.980
The factory heads will arrive tomorrow.

28:45.980 --> 28:47.500
The meeting time is up to you.

28:48.260 --> 28:49.539
And the materials and R&D team?

28:49.819 --> 28:50.700
All arranged.

28:50.859 --> 28:52.859
Dr. Zhang is pretty much
on board to sign.

28:53.660 --> 28:54.260
Got it.

29:02.824 --> 29:05.736
(Yunsheng Tower)

29:06.420 --> 29:08.020
(He sent me home when I was sick)

29:08.020 --> 29:09.299
(and got me yellow peach cans.)

29:09.460 --> 29:10.539
(Plus the comforting text.)

29:10.859 --> 29:12.460
(He must like me, right?)

29:12.900 --> 29:14.819
(Why is the fondness still 22 percent?)

29:15.144 --> 29:16.420
(Fondness: 22.2 percent)

29:16.420 --> 29:17.500
(22.2 percent?)

29:20.660 --> 29:21.900
Huan'er, here.

29:22.299 --> 29:23.099
Fuchuang requires us

29:23.099 --> 29:24.500
to deliver the next quarter's

29:24.500 --> 29:25.539
marketing concept

29:25.660 --> 29:26.740
and proposal

29:26.740 --> 29:28.539
for Hongsen Supermarket by 3 PM today.

29:28.539 --> 29:29.900
- (You went to a loan shark?)
- Then we should

29:30.020 --> 29:31.379
- (Some men in black came.)
- make sure to deliver...

29:31.500 --> 29:32.619
(Don't come back.)

29:32.619 --> 29:33.859
(Remember, stay away.)

29:34.460 --> 29:36.740
Something seems to have happened
at my home.

29:37.819 --> 29:38.740
Something happened?

29:39.260 --> 29:40.139
Most likely.

29:40.139 --> 29:41.299
Then you should go quickly.

29:41.579 --> 29:42.280
Then...

29:42.539 --> 29:43.500
Work isn't important.

29:43.660 --> 29:44.619
Family comes first.

29:46.099 --> 29:46.900
- Thanks.
- Wang Zhen,

29:47.579 --> 29:48.200
you go.

29:50.379 --> 29:51.660
What's going on?

29:54.139 --> 29:55.139
Where's my home?

30:01.740 --> 30:03.460
You've misunderstood. We didn't do it.

30:03.859 --> 30:05.900
You're accusing the wrong people.

30:06.220 --> 30:07.940
We're all good people here.

30:10.220 --> 30:10.980
Is this the place?

30:11.460 --> 30:12.139
Sweetie.

30:12.200 --> 30:12.859
Yeah, here.

30:12.859 --> 30:14.020
You came back after all.

30:14.460 --> 30:15.020
Come quickly.

30:15.900 --> 30:16.619
Miss Lin,

30:16.619 --> 30:17.619
you're finally back.

30:17.619 --> 30:19.139
We only came to deliver a message,

30:19.139 --> 30:20.660
but Mr. Lin won't let us leave now.

30:20.660 --> 30:22.059
Total misunderstanding.

30:22.059 --> 30:23.260
What are you talking about?

30:23.260 --> 30:25.660
Sweetie, they hit me.

30:25.660 --> 30:26.779
Sir, you're lying.

30:27.020 --> 30:29.500
Did you hit him? Did you?

30:29.500 --> 30:31.099
Impossible! How could we hit you?

30:31.180 --> 30:32.379
Would we dare hit him?

30:32.379 --> 30:34.020
No? And then?

30:34.020 --> 30:35.299
Don't listen to him at all.

30:35.299 --> 30:36.740
We couldn't possibly hit anyone.

30:36.740 --> 30:38.740
And they smashed up our place. Look.

30:38.940 --> 30:40.020
That didn't happen at all.

30:40.020 --> 30:41.099
We couldn't have done it.

30:41.099 --> 30:42.500
You're misled. Don't believe him.

30:42.500 --> 30:43.700
He smashed our place.

30:43.940 --> 30:44.859
He smashed everything.

30:45.379 --> 30:46.379
- Alright.
- Everything!

30:46.379 --> 30:47.420
Quiet. Be quiet.

30:47.700 --> 30:48.579
Let me sort this out.

30:48.940 --> 30:50.619
First, let me get this straight.

30:51.299 --> 30:53.339
You're my alcoholic dad, right?

30:54.139 --> 30:55.299
I didn't drink today.

30:55.460 --> 30:56.420
You didn't drink today?

30:56.859 --> 30:57.859
Then I should have

30:57.859 --> 30:59.099
a loner sister.

30:59.619 --> 31:00.740
I'm right here.

31:01.859 --> 31:02.619
What's going on?

31:02.940 --> 31:04.099
Dad, stop acting.

31:04.099 --> 31:05.220
She won't believe you.

31:06.099 --> 31:07.299
What are you talking about?

31:07.299 --> 31:08.940
You can't side with outsiders.

31:10.020 --> 31:10.819
You're young.

31:10.819 --> 31:11.779
You wouldn't lie.

31:11.980 --> 31:12.779
I'll listen to you.

31:13.220 --> 31:14.660
You never came home.

31:14.660 --> 31:15.940
So Dad seized the chance

31:15.940 --> 31:17.099
to lure you back.

31:19.539 --> 31:20.260
And them?

31:20.539 --> 31:22.660
They said you took money
from their boss,

31:22.660 --> 31:23.740
but didn't do the job well.

31:23.980 --> 31:25.779
So they wanted Dad to help them out.

31:27.379 --> 31:28.379
You work for Mr. Gao?

31:29.460 --> 31:31.180
Miss Lin, we really didn't hit anyone.

31:31.180 --> 31:32.740
The mess on the floor wasn't our doing.

31:32.740 --> 31:34.379
Yes, we're professionals.

31:34.379 --> 31:35.528
- We're pros.
- We wouldn't do such things.

31:35.528 --> 31:36.099
Right.

31:36.099 --> 31:37.099
You are pros?

31:37.099 --> 31:38.579
Then how did Sweetie and Spicy

31:38.579 --> 31:39.500
fall on the floor?

31:39.500 --> 31:40.660
Who smashed them? Who?

31:40.660 --> 31:41.779
It wasn't us.

31:42.139 --> 31:43.500
We don't know who did it.

31:43.619 --> 31:45.660
Regarding Sweetie and Spicy,

31:45.660 --> 31:47.260
if it was you guys...

31:54.059 --> 31:55.420
All right. You can leave.

31:56.099 --> 31:57.059
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

31:58.500 --> 31:59.139
Stop.

32:00.379 --> 32:01.299
Where's Mr. Gao?

32:01.299 --> 32:02.139
Take me to see him.

32:02.420 --> 32:04.059
Sweetie, you can't go with them.

32:04.059 --> 32:05.579
They're all bad guys. It's dangerous.

32:05.579 --> 32:07.500
Enough. They're just workers.

32:07.500 --> 32:08.020
Yes.

32:08.020 --> 32:10.020
Exactly. We're just workhorses.

32:10.940 --> 32:12.980
Then are you coming back?

32:13.379 --> 32:14.579
I'll be right back.

32:14.779 --> 32:16.579
I'll cook something tasty while I wait.

32:18.539 --> 32:19.304
Okay, no problem.

32:19.389 --> 32:20.072
You cook.

32:21.220 --> 32:21.819
Lead the way.

32:22.059 --> 32:22.660
Okay.

32:23.819 --> 32:24.500
Take care of Dad.

32:24.779 --> 32:25.539
Don't worry.

32:27.900 --> 32:29.819
Remember to call us.

32:34.579 --> 32:36.020
Sweetie and Spicy.

32:37.099 --> 32:38.379
I can't turn in my homework.

32:40.020 --> 32:41.099
The teacher will scold me.

32:55.560 --> 32:57.128
(Exclusive: Letao CEO Gao Haiming
Dating Mysterious Woman)

33:04.424 --> 33:05.139
Hello?

33:05.139 --> 33:06.660
Haiming, it's me.

33:07.420 --> 33:08.059
Sir.

33:08.660 --> 33:09.980
I'm at the cigar bar now.

33:10.740 --> 33:11.900
Don't hang up the phone.

33:12.260 --> 33:13.740
I'll be meeting Lin Huan'er soon.

33:15.020 --> 33:16.260
I want you to hear

33:16.660 --> 33:17.500
what kind of woman

33:17.500 --> 33:19.139
Lin Huan'er really is.

33:43.180 --> 33:44.660
(Exclusive)
This was your doing, right?

33:50.779 --> 33:51.420
Yes.

33:52.460 --> 33:53.420
I arranged it.

33:54.059 --> 33:55.539
The photos turned out well, right?

33:56.779 --> 33:57.819
As you can see,

33:58.299 --> 34:00.460
Gao Haiming and I are currently in love.

34:01.064 --> 34:01.900
Love deeply.

34:04.339 --> 34:07.579
You sound so self-righteous.

34:09.780 --> 34:10.820
Don't forget

34:10.820 --> 34:13.179
what you promised me when you

34:13.179 --> 34:14.340
took my money in the car.

34:14.340 --> 34:14.860
Mr. Gao.

34:15.219 --> 34:17.059
Taking payment and doing the job

34:17.059 --> 34:18.579
is perfectly justified, right?

34:19.179 --> 34:20.699
Now you act one way in front of me

34:20.699 --> 34:22.099
and another behind my back.

34:22.460 --> 34:24.699
Isn't that rather underhanded?

34:25.619 --> 34:28.059
Mr. Gao, you sent people
to harass my family.

34:28.460 --> 34:30.340
Was that not underhanded?

34:30.780 --> 34:32.340
It seems I didn't offer you

34:32.340 --> 34:33.460
enough incentive, did I?

34:33.820 --> 34:35.020
I wasn't wrong about you.

34:35.020 --> 34:36.460
You're truly a greedy

34:36.460 --> 34:38.059
and insatiable woman.

34:43.179 --> 34:43.900
I admit it.

34:46.059 --> 34:47.340
Not only am I vain.

34:47.900 --> 34:49.179
I'm also insatiably greedy.

34:50.139 --> 34:52.380
How candidly you admit it.

34:52.380 --> 34:53.860
I rather like that.

34:54.780 --> 34:55.460
Tell me.

34:55.460 --> 34:56.659
How much do you want

34:56.980 --> 34:58.259
to leave my son?

34:59.139 --> 34:59.940
Name your price.

35:01.460 --> 35:03.820
You seem to have forgotten
our five-month arrangement.

35:04.020 --> 35:05.940
I remember the five-month agreement.

35:06.500 --> 35:09.500
I thought you were setting up

35:10.460 --> 35:12.020
for an expensive breakup settlement.

35:12.579 --> 35:13.739
But I never expected

35:14.420 --> 35:15.860
it was merely your stalling tactic.

35:15.860 --> 35:17.259
Your real goal

35:17.259 --> 35:19.659
has been to latch onto my son Haiming,

35:19.659 --> 35:21.219
climbing the social ladder.

35:21.699 --> 35:23.500
How delusional you are.

35:24.099 --> 35:25.500
You're not just insatiable.

35:25.500 --> 35:27.020
You're also scheming.

35:30.099 --> 35:31.219
My point is,

35:32.500 --> 35:34.739
Gao Haiming isn't some puppet.

35:35.940 --> 35:37.460
How could I possibly control him

35:37.460 --> 35:38.699
to execute my plans?

35:39.179 --> 35:39.940
Likewise,

35:40.420 --> 35:42.020
I doubt you can control him either.

35:42.420 --> 35:43.659
Why would I control him?

35:44.980 --> 35:45.860
We're perfectly fine.

35:45.860 --> 35:46.980
Why would I control him?

35:47.500 --> 35:48.820
I just want him to realize

35:48.820 --> 35:49.820
what kind of woman

35:49.820 --> 35:51.380
by his side truly is.

35:56.739 --> 35:58.020
If I were you,

35:58.900 --> 36:00.619
before summoning that woman here,

36:01.139 --> 36:03.460
I'd have talked to my son first

36:03.860 --> 36:05.820
to understand his perspective.

36:06.739 --> 36:08.059
Is he my son

36:08.579 --> 36:10.099
or your son?

36:10.940 --> 36:12.300
Don't I know him?

36:12.619 --> 36:13.860
Why should I talk with him?

36:14.539 --> 36:15.940
I only need to talk to you.

36:16.300 --> 36:17.739
Stop beating around the bush.

36:18.340 --> 36:19.699
I'll ask you one last time.

36:20.380 --> 36:22.219
Just how much money

36:22.780 --> 36:24.460
will it take for you to leave my son?

36:33.860 --> 36:34.860
It seems to you

36:35.940 --> 36:37.659
that only money can solve problems.

36:39.619 --> 36:41.780
I don't think
you understand Gao Haiming at all.

36:43.340 --> 36:44.699
Nor do you know what he needs

36:44.699 --> 36:46.059
and what he truly wants.

36:47.579 --> 36:48.460
Or rather,

36:49.300 --> 36:50.699
you simply don't care.

36:55.659 --> 36:56.460
By the way, Mr. Gao.

37:00.020 --> 37:00.820
No need to count it.

37:01.780 --> 37:02.619
Not a cent short.

37:26.673 --> 37:29.656
♪Entwined worries linger♪

37:30.865 --> 37:33.636
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

37:35.537 --> 37:41.450
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

37:43.247 --> 37:46.307
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

